{"quest_id": 6349, "name": "邪仙の出迎え", "description": "華の国に辿り着いた一行を、邪仙屍解仙が\n待ち受ける。迫るキョンシーを退け、\nランファを狙う邪仙の企みを阻止せよ！\n上級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv10）", "event": "屍人想ウ華ノ残香", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920102, "map_no": 5280, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 40, "exp": 250, "gold": 1000, "drops": [{"card": 40, "c": 1}, {"card": 338, "c": 1}, {"card": 59, "c": 1}, {"item": 2001, "c": 1}, {"item": 5002, "c": 2}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 18, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 3500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 3500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 1, "attack_interval": 54, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2108080, "master_id": 991, "global_id": 990, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 28, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 3500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 3500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 151, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2106672, "master_id": 842, "global_id": 841, "spawn_sec": 7}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 45000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 45000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 500, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 30, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 91, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2106736, "special_effect_id": 82, "missile_id": 6, "master_id": 30871, "global_id": 4490, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 93}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 6000, "attack": 700, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 700, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 186, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2106688, "master_id": 849, "global_id": 848, "spawn_sec": 149}], "popups": ["屍解仙は拠点には\n向かわず、しばらくすると\n戦場からいなくなります。\n\n倒さなくても★の評価には\n影響しません。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "華の国らしい街並みが見えてきましたね。\nなにか手がかりが見つかるといいのですが……。"}, {"name": "フェイ", "text": "ねえ、ランファさん。\n記憶にある景色に近づいてる感じはする？", "face": "u434"}, {"name": "ランファ", "text": "……申し訳ありません。\n恐縮ですが、まだなんとも……。", "face": "u579"}, {"name": "屍解仙", "text": "――探したぞ、意志を持つキョンシーよ。\nしかし、なぜ王子たちと共におるのじゃ？", "face": "l099aa390a131"}, {"name": "ランファ", "text": "え？　あの、貴方は……？", "face": "u579"}, {"name": "マオ", "text": "お前は――屍解仙！？\nまさか、ランファさんをキョンシーにしたのは……。", "face": "u361"}, {"name": "屍解仙", "text": "カッカッカ……どの死体をキョンシーにしたかなど、\nいちいち憶えてはおらぬわ。", "face": "l099aa390a131"}, {"name": "屍解仙", "text": "わしはただ、意志のあるキョンシーが\n近くをうろついているという噂を聞いて\n研究に有用かもしれぬから回収しようと思ったまでよ。", "face": "l099aa390a131"}, {"name": "ランファ", "text": "死体……回収……？\n研究に有用……ですって？", "face": "u579"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "酷い……人をなんだと思って――", "face": "l03600a243b7b"}, {"name": "屍解仙", "text": "――人？　カッカッカ、笑わせるわい。\n術によって仮初の命を与えられた死体の分際が。\nキョンシーなど我ら邪仙の奴隷、いや道具に過ぎぬわ。", "face": "l099aa390a131"}, {"name": "ランファ", "text": "……っ！", "face": "u579"}, {"name": "屍解仙", "text": "話は終わりじゃ。ゆけ、キョンシーども！\n邪魔者どもを退け、あの女キョンシーを捕獲せい！", "face": "l099aa390a131"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "屍解仙", "text": "ちぃっ……人間風情に後れを取るとは。\nここは一旦退くしかあるまい。", "face": "l099aa390a131"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "――敵わぬと見るや逃げの一手か。\n手慣れたものだな、屍解仙よ？", "face": "u630"}, {"name": "屍解仙", "text": "なッ――その声は……！？", "face": "l099aa390a131"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "……だが、ただでは逃さぬ。\n我ら邪仙の品格を卑しめてくれたお前に、\nこの私が直々に灸を据えてやろう……それ！", "face": "u630"}, {"name": "屍解仙", "text": "――ぐぁぁあぁあああッ！！\nこ……この技は、やはり……ッ！", "face": "l099aa390a131"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "あははははッ！\n流石は屍解仙、いい声で鳴くではないか。", "face": "u630"}, {"name": "ランファ", "text": "あ、貴方は一体……？", "face": "u579"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………。", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子！　危険です、お下がりください！", "face": "l03600a243b7b"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "ほう、お前が噂の王子か。\n会いたかったぞ……ふふっ。", "face": "u630"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920102_5280", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 195, "y": 533}, {"k": "b", "x": 498, "y": 533}, {"k": "b", "x": 790, "y": 533}, {"k": "m", "x": 789, "y": 207, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 196, "y": 206, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 789, "y": 346, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 788, "y": 470, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 498, "y": 207, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 496, "y": 470, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 496, "y": 347, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 195, "y": 336, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 194, "y": 470, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 647, "y": 413, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 644, "y": 231, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 350, "y": 266, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 349, "y": 372, "id": 212}, {"k": "r", "x": 560, "y": 458, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 721, "y": 470, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 396, "y": 316, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 280, "y": 448, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 599, "y": 328, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 666, "y": 186, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 326, "y": 213, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 428, "y": 419, "id": 307}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true, "name_en": "The Evil Immortal's Greeting", "description_en": "The group is awaited in the Land of Flowers by the Evil Immortal Shikai-sen.\nRepel the approaching Jiangshi and stop the Evil Immortal's plot against Lan-Fa! Advanced (★1 acquisition benchmark: Avg Lv10)"}